// PYTHON_PRINTABLE_BITMAP_HASH is FNV-1a 64 over the bitmap of the range
// above: every code point 0x0..0x10ffff in order, the printable bit of
// each packed into a byte most-significant first. The Odin suite recomputes
// it through the compiled predicate
// (tests/http_test.odin:test_str_is_printable_matches_the_generated_bitmap),
// so the table and `str_is_printable` are checked against the reference's
// database for every code point and not only for the ones a scenario names.
PYTHON_PRINTABLE_BITMAP_HASH :: u64(0xfd99b59d3167042d)
